@Todo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5170
@TodoItemId = 019fda15-5e46-7cb4-a1c6-7a00700d2503

### Criar tarefa (v1)
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todo-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Escrever a documentação",
  "description": "Descrever o padrão de endpoints no README",
  "dueDate": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Buscar tarefa por id (v1)
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todo-items/{{TodoItemId}}
Accept: application/json

### Criar tarefa (v2) — difere da v1 por devolver o header Location
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v2/todo-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Escrever a documentação",
  "description": "Descrever o padrão de endpoints no README",
  "dueDate": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Buscar tarefa por id (v2)
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v2/todo-items/{{TodoItemId}}
Accept: application/json

### Falha de validação — dueDate no passado
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todo-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "dueDate": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Documento OpenAPI da v1
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Documento OpenAPI da v2
GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v2.json
Accept: application/json
